eda</a>\r\n<a class=\"hover:text-blue-600\" href=\"/refrigerator-service-center-kheda\">Fridge Service Center Kheda</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- PRICING TABLE -->\r\n\r\n<section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-20 px-4 max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-10\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4 italic text-gray-900\">AC Installation &amp; Material Price List</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-500\">Fixed transparent rates as per our verified <a class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\" href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\">Standard AC Service Price List</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-gray-200\">\r\n<table class=\"w-full text-left\">\r\n<thead class=\"bg-blue-900 text-white\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<th class=\"p-6\">Feature</th>\r\n<th class=\"p-6\">3-Star Inverter</th>\r\n<th class=\"p-6 text-blue-300 font-bold\">5-Star Inverter (Best for Kheda)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody class=\"divide-y text-gray-600 text-sm\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"p-6 font-semibold\">Annual Savings</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-6\">~₹1,500/year</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-6 text-green-600 font-bold\">~₹4,500/year</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"p-6 font-semibold\">Cooling Speed</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-6\">Standard</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-6\">Turbo (15% Faster)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"p-6 font-semibold\">Environment Impact</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-6\">Low</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-6\">Ultra-Low (R32 Gas)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- PRE-INSTALLATION CHECKLIST -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"py-20 px-4\">\r\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-blue-900 rounded-[3rem] p-10 md:p-16 text-white flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center shadow-2xl\">\r\n<div class=\"lg:w-1/2\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">Homeowner&#8217;s Pre-Installation Checklist</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-blue-200 mb-8\">Maximize the life of your unit. Check these before the Atlas Aircon team arrives for your <a class=\"text-blue-300 font-bold hover:underline\" href=\"/split-ac-service-kheda\">Split AC Setup</a>:</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400\"></i> Power socket (16A) ready?</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400\"></i> Outdoor ledge space clear?</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400\"></i> Drain pipe route cleared?</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400\"></i> Societies NOC taken?</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"lg:w-1/2 glass-effect p-8 rounded-3xl text-gray-900\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Installation Material Support</h3>\r\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-gray-600 text-sm\">We provide high-grade materials for <a class=\"text-blue-700 font-medium\" href=\"/ducting-repair-services-kheda\">ducting repairs</a> and new installations.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-6 text-sm\">\r\n \t<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\">Professional Mounting <strong>Fixed Rate</strong></li>\r\n \t<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\">Extra <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/copper-pipe/\">Copper Pipe</a> <strong>Standard Cost</strong></li>\r\n \t<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\">MS <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/outdoor-stand/\">Wall Stand</a> <strong>Standard Rate</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<a class=\"block w-full text-center bg-blue-600 text-white py-3 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-lg transform transition hover:-translate-y-1\" href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book Your Service Now</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- FAQ SECTION -->\r\n\r\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-white\">\r\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12\">Expert HVAC Insights for Kheda Residents</h2>\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4\"><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">Why is my new AC not cooling efficiently in Nadiad&#8217;s heat?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Usually, this is due to improper vacuuming or gas pressure. For industrial complexes, ensuring proper <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/air-handling-unit-services-kheda\">AHU services</a> and ducting is vital for cooling efficiency.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">Which AC brand is best for the dusty Kheda climate?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Brands like <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/daikin-ac-service-center-kheda\">Daikin</a> and <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/o-general-ac-service-center-kheda\">O General</a> are popular for their robust build. However, frequent <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/ac-service-kheda\">AC service in Kheda</a> is more important than the brand to prevent dust buildup.</p>\r\n\r\n</details><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">Do you repair other cooling appliances?\r\n<span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Yes, we provide <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/refrigerator-repair-services-kheda\">refrigerator repair in Kheda</a>, <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/air-cooler-repair-services-kheda\">air cooler repair</a>, and industrial <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/chiller-repair-services-kheda\">chiller repair services</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n</details></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><!-- FINAL CTA -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"py-24 px-4 hero-gradient text-white text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-6\">Ready for World-Class Cooling?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-10\">Professional installation is just a call away. Trust the engineering experts for your home or business.</p>\r\n<a class=\"inline-block bg-white text-blue-900 px-12 py-5 rounded-2xl font-black text-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transform hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-2xl\" href=\"tel:+919727257141\">\r\n<i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt mr-2\"></i> Call Atlas Aircon Now\r\n</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</section>",
